Z||000005||grinthock||09-17-2001||05:13 PM||||Oh SH1T Guys you have no idea, Slammed took be for a jaunt in that thing, at 100 klm/hr he nailed the brakes and I wished I had a 4 point!  I am suprised the car doesn't pull the body off the frame (or something similar!)  it stops SO DAMN FAST and HARD.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroworldbanner.gif"> </A> <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
