Z||000007||Slammed Fiero||09-17-2001||05:51 PM||||the stop was from 60 mph to 0. As for the vericom I borrowed it from my local club , there over $1000 to buy on e new , I will see if I can't dig upa  site on it , I believe my spelling is wrong.<P>as for the brakes themselves...I followed this<P> <A HREF="http://www.terranexus.com/fieroman/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.terranexus.com/fieroman/</A> <P>Look for the 11.25" brake upgrade , it's a link from that page.<P>The major parts of the conversion are the caliper adaptors and the front hubs. There also the most expensive part. <P>JM ||||reg||1
